OL,3,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs
OL,4,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince New York City officials postponed
OL,7,Fthe Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade, a
OL,8,Fprecaution ahead of a storm that
OL,9,Fbrought heavy rain, wind and flooding,
OL,10,Fhundreds of touring performers who
OL,11,Ftraveled from across the US to perform
OL,12,Fwere thrust into chaos.
OL,14,F"It was jarring," said Ryan Demkovich,
OL,15,Fdirector of a Texas high school
OL,16,Fmarching band. After learning the news,
OL,17,Fhe had to scramble to make new
OL,18,Farrangements for over 500 people.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
