OL,3,AMarching bands scramble to cover costs
OL,4,Aafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemkovich and his Pearland High School
OL,7,Fband made the quick decision to launch
OL,8,Fa fundraiser, reaching $350,000
OL,9,F(#267,000) in just a few hours.
OL,11,FStill, some performers reportedly had
OL,12,Fto skip the parade, a televised,
OL,13,Ftraditional Thanksgiving event - now
OL,14,Frescheduled for Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
